maya: Quick heads-up: onboarding sample app user hit a confusing error blob on auth failure. SDKs return different shapes across langs — we should harmonize ASAP. Suggestion: stable typed errors + small user-facing fields.
sam: Can you paste the examples?
maya: iOS sample app sends {"error":"Unauthorized","detail":{"code":401,"msg":"token expired"}} but JS SDK throws HTTPError {status:401, body:'Unauthorized'} — hard to handle uniformly.
jordan: Also seeing 429s without Retry-After header from Dedicated edge; devs get no guidance.
liam: Proposal: expose AuthError (401/403), RateLimitError (429 with retry_after_seconds), ServiceError (5xx). Keep http_status and message for compat.
maya: add fields: internal_code (stable string), human_message, docs_url. Keeps sampleapp logs tidy.
sam: How to avoid breaking changes? Add fields non-breaking and feature-flag them for 2w. Then deprecate legacy shapes later.
jordan: I'll add e2e test in sampleapp asserting typed exceptions.
liam: ops-bot note: server must include Retry-After on 429.
ops-bot: INF-512 created for adding Retry-After header (P2).
maya: Owners: sam (sdk + sample snippets), liam (service headers), jordan (tests + docs). I'll run a canary and watch telemetry.
sam: Quick onboarding snippet we'll add:
```js
try {
  await client.generate(...);
} catch (err) {
  if (err.code === 'auth_error' || err instanceof AuthError) {
    await refreshToken(); // retry once
  } else if (err instanceof RateLimitError || err.retry_after_seconds) {
    // backoff using err.retry_after_seconds or exp backoff
  } else {
    throw err;
  }
}
```
jordan: Also add tiny doc mapping: 401/403->AuthError, 429->RateLimitError(with retry_after), 5xx->ServiceError.
maya: tiny UX note: sampleapp should log only human_message + correlation_id, avoid full stack dumps. devex-bot can we add a dashboard?
devex-bot: Created dashboard "error_shape_adoption" and watch for legacy-shape spikes.
liam: Timeline: PRs by EOW, server header change early next week, feature-flag 2w, canary monitor.
maya: thanks — sam open the PR and include changelog and sampleapp snippet. :rocket:
